---
description: |
  Translates an OCSF 1.9 event to Splunk CIM. Derives captions that the event
  omits from their IDs, and passes events of unsupported classes through
  unchanged. The CIM record holds no Splunk metadata, such as `host`, `source`,
  or the HEC `time`: keep the OCSF event next to it with `into` and bind the
  metadata in `to_splunk`.
args:
  positional:
    - name: event
      type: field
      default: this
      description: The OCSF event to translate.
  named:
    - name: into
      type: field
      default: this
      description: The field that receives the CIM record.
---

$into = $event
splunk::cim::ocsf::map event=$into
